<main id="content" class="site-main post mt-article"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">The Inspiring Water Feature Trends</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p class="mt-article-meta"><time datetime="2021-05-03T11:20:14">May 3, 2021</time></p><figure class="mt-article-hero"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends-jpg.avif" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends-jpg-50x50.avif 50w, /wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends-jpg.avif 768w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 860px" width="768" height="445" alt="The Inspiring Water Feature Trends" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></figure><div class="mt-article-body"><p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-attachment-id="77984" data-permalink="https://www.midwest-tropical.com/the-inspiring-water-feature-trends-3/" data-orig-file="/wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends-jpg.avif" data-orig-size="768,445" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="/wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends-jpg.avif" crossorigin="anonymous" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-77984" src="/wp-content/uploads/The-Inspiring-Water-Feature-Trends1.jpg" alt="The Inspiring Water Feature Trends " width="828" height="480" title=""></p>
<p>The versatility of water features has enabled them to survive over the centuries, hinting at their ability to adjust to any surroundings. Many commercial properties are installing indoor water features due to various reasons.</p>
<p>Midwest Tropical hopes to keep up with the ever-increasing demand for water features that are predicted to last forever. Technology has opened up many options, due to which water features have become the must-have option for all interior decorators. The water feature trend is bent towards certain designs that have become quite popular for most people.</p>
<p>Check out these water features that are making waves in the world of the commercial interior.</p>
<h2><strong>Wall waterfalls </strong></h2>
<p>It is a water feature that creates a cascading ripple effect that is mesmerizing and dramatic. The biggest advantage of these water features is that they do not require any extensive floor space. All you need is a wall to install this exquisite water feature. The design and size depending on the space you have and the style statement you wish to achieve. This water effect is captivating and looks classic, sophisticated while offering pleasing aesthetics.</p>
<h2><strong>Bubble Water Features</strong></h2>
<p>It is a technological marvel. The bubble walls are seeing an impressive rise in demand that is predicted to only grow further with time. The technology has allowed water features like bubble walls to be fully customized according to your specifications and can be used for various purposes apart from decorative. Many restaurateurs opt to use bubble walls as partitions or noise reducers; health clinics use them to keep the waiting area calm and quiet, while many business premises use them to fill empty wall space. You can install swirly bubble walls, bubble wall chambers, or custom bubble walls. The possibilities are endless!</p>
<h2><strong>Tabletop fountains </strong></h2>
<p>Tabletop fountains are than all other water features such as window waterfall and fountains. As the name suggests, they only require a table and is ideal for office spaces where something large and extravagant does not seem to fit. As they say, less is more!</p>
<p>Tabletop fountains are ideally suited for people that want to introduce natural elements into their hectic lives while also having the option of sprucing up the place effortlessly. They are quick and easy to install and can be tailored according to your requirements. The design, color, and material used can be made to blend in well with the existing decor of your office, making the water feature an excellent extension of the theme.</p>
<h2><strong>Wall fountains</strong></h2>
<p>Wall fountains are mounted on walls creating striking styles. This water feature also needs a wall, which is the primary reason for its popularity. The extra space can be utilized for creating an efficient and spacious working place that also enjoys the pleasing effects of a customized water feature. Instead of looking for run-of-the-mill items that are cheap and come with no guarantee of being an original, choose a water feature that will never grow old and be just as authentic as your brand.</p>
<p>Midwest Tropical has an eclectic collection of water features. If you want it to have your signature, then customizing it is nothing more than a snap. If you wish to make your business premises stand out from the crowd and exude the subtle vibes of class and modernity, then water features have the ability to do it all.</p>
</div></div></main>

